WEBVTT

00:00:13.436 --> 00:00:13.936
help you.

00:00:15.036 --> 00:00:16.316
I wanna hear you say-

00:00:16.412 --> 00:00:17.292
I love you.

00:00:42.476 --> 00:00:42.936
What's this?

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:43.596
Peace.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:45.620
Where's everybody else?

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:14.120
Hey, Neo, could you tell your father you want to live with me?

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:16.930
We would be together every day if you can do that.

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:22.920
I'm guessing he's going to marry her, right?

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.860
She's already living with us, so maybe.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:30.340
Yeah.

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:33.290
You're all so selfish.

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:35.690
Mio, I don't blame you.

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:37.410
You have every reason to be angry.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:42.000
Listen, some things you won't understand until you're older.

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:44.630
Then why don't you just stop me things I won't understand?

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:46.290
Mio!

00:02:00.508 --> 00:02:01.508
I hate this.

00:02:02.204 --> 00:02:04.204
I hate this stupid world so much.

00:02:06.364 --> 00:02:07.724
I wish the world would end soon.

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:25.840
Welcome.

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.200
Wanna try one on?

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:03.230
Grumpy as usual, I see

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.880
But just as gorgeous as ever

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.340
What are you talking about?

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.810
What is it?

00:03:11.930 --> 00:03:19.520
My bag!

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:31.340
Ah!

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.650
Did you hear what he just said to me?

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:07.270
He said, I can't wait.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:09.340
Sounds promising, doesn't it?

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:14.300
He meant, I just, I can't wait a minute longer to kiss you.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:14.660
Morning.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:15.970
Our eyes met.

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:17.480
It was like crazy.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:18.900
Seriously, that thing.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:19.560
And then what?

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:20.360
That's it, unfortunately.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:23.080
I got to hear Hinode's sexy.

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:25.540
I could die happy now, know what I mean?

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:26.900
Not even slightly.

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:29.900
Hey, Hinode, you should try being a bit nicer to Muge.

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:35.540
Yeah, true. In fact, what you should do is whisper in her ear with that sexy voice of yours.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:39.320
Hey, that really hurt. What the heck is your problem?

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:43.670
Shut up! Let me hear anything else from you too. Zip it!

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:51.910
Would you let me record your voice on my phone? I'll listen to it before I fall asleep and my dreams will be magical.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:56.740
Muge is a good name for her, Miss Ultra Gaga and Eccentric.

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.760
She said I can't wait!

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:08.260
This is getting kind of sad, you know.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:09.690
What is?

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:12.010
He's not interested, but you won't give up.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:13.610
It's depressing at this point.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.530
Oh, I guess.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:18.170
We still know that girl is as close to him as me.

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:19.570
That means I'm special, right?

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:21.850
You're really starting to sound like a true stalker.

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:24.180
Tell me something, why Hinode anyway?

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:27.500
He used to always give you signals to back off.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:28.910
Now he just ignores you.

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:29.860
Hey, Yuri!

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:30.480
What?

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:31.860
Curious?

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:36.270
Remember the time it rained during the festival?

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:40.450
Yeah, the one I couldn't go to because I was at my grandmother's memorial service.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.560
Well, that day, we were huddled close together.

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:46.360
Just the two of us.

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:50.100
It was so quiet, you couldn't even tell there was a festival going on.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:54.230
It's like everything else has disappeared.

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:55.660
Yeah, you're right.

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:59.730
The world is filled with so many things that I hate and things that I don't need.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:07.820
But if those things aren't around when my time here is finally over, well, I guess I wouldn't want it to be like that.

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:12.780
Oh, that you're so profound.

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.410
I wouldn't want that, that's all.

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:32.650
I laugh just like a child.

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:33.930
You know that.

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:37.980
I was sick of this world, but now I know it isn't so bad.

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.790
Because I met Noday after all.

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:42.390
Hey, Muge!

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:45.260
Would you get a grip already?

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.640
You're getting your fantasies confused with reality.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.700
Aw, it was my ice cream too.

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:51.820
This is pathetic.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.300
I can't take it.

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:56.360
Come back to us now.

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:58.180
Earth to Muge!

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:01.810
It really happened.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:02.820
Why won't you believe?

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:11.770
Wow, I didn't know you hated cats.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.080
Depends on the time, the place, and the cat.

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:16.760
See you later.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.050
Don't burn again tomorrow, okay?

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:22.210
You really are such a weirdo.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:23.350
See you.

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:24.040
Bye.

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:38.680
Oh, hold on, Mio.

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.950
Are you feeling all right, my dear?

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:45.000
Oh my, look at how much weight you've lost.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.560
You're all skin and bones.

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:49.250
No, no, I haven't lost any weight.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:51.690
You poor thing.

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:54.590
You don't know how sorry I feel for you, Mio.

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:56.190
I really shouldn't.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:56.790
I'm fine.

00:07:56.930 --> 00:07:58.550
Has she been feeding you properly?

00:07:59.010 --> 00:07:59.830
Yes, yeah, of course.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.930
She's living with you now, isn't she?

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.140
Tell me, is she forcing you to eat food that you don't like?

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:05.980
No, Mio.

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:10.440
It's so nice to see you.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:10.940
Hello.

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:12.720
Bye now, Mio dear.

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:15.160
I have to be on my way.

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:23.730
They can't stop nosing around once they reach her age, huh?

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:25.010
I'm back now, Kaoru.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:26.700
I'm glad you're home, Mio.

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:28.470
Kinako!

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:35.770
Hey, the weather's supposed to be sunny tomorrow, too.

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:37.890
I'll be airing the futon mattresses, so...

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:39.350
You don't have to worry about mine.

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:41.680
It'll be fluffier after I air it, though.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:43.540
It's fine. I'll do it myself next time.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:44.750
I don't want to trouble you.

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:45.730
I really don't mind.

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:54.700
Hi, Kinako. I'm back now.

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:59.130
I guess you have to raise him from a young age to make him like you.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.040
Oh, there's some ice cream in the fridge.

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:05.430
But I already had one on my way home.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:06.230
Really?

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:08.240
You should help yourself, Kaoru.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:09.800
You and Kinako.

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:10.770
Okay.

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:14.430
Oh, I'll let you know when dinner's ready.

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:18.440
Kinako, do you want a treat?

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:27.150
I know she's trying to be nice, but she should just leave me alone.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.280
I have my own plans.

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:32.920
Let's see, where is it?

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:43.410
I said, I have my own plans.

00:09:58.370 --> 00:09:58.610
Key.

00:09:59.230 --> 00:09:59.370
Huh.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:23.870
Yumi, would you please try to make yourself useful?

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:25.780
Help me fold the laundry.

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:26.940
Hey.

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:29.070
I'm home.

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:30.690
Hey, Kento.

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:32.160
Kento?

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:34.800
What a bummer.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:38.890
Explain yourself.

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:40.520
Why is this here?

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:41.920
Why didn't you hand this in?

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:45.560
You are going to Ichihai, right?

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.120
I'm still thinking about it.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.290
You have to take this seriously.

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:51.970
We're depending on you to support this family, you know.

00:10:52.220 --> 00:10:53.980
Wow, seriously, Mom?

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:56.040
You're expecting the son to feed the family?

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:57.610
It's old passion of you.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:58.010
It's not like you're helpful.

00:10:58.290 --> 00:10:59.050
I'm home now, Dad.

00:10:59.290 --> 00:10:59.530
Okay, okay.

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:02.220
If you're going to your grandpa's,

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.900
make sure that you finish your homework first.

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.260
I don't have any homework.

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:10.730
The panties are huge!

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:27.600
Taro? Taro?

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.760
She isn't here yet.

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:38.280
Taro! Taro?

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:07.670
You smell just like the sun, you know that?

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:21.090
So, what are you doing down there?

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:26.950
She has a lot on her mind.

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:28.270
You can't blame her.

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:29.770
Don't worry about it.

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:32.570
The truth is, you're a lot smarter than I am.

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:35.140
I can see why Sachko has high hopes for you.

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:37.870
Yeah, well, I think you're cool, Grandpa.

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:51.600
State of your heart will always show in your work.

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:52.470
Right.

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:55.890
Are you hungry?

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:02.660
Grandpa, can I use your kitchen?

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:05.240
Okay, why don't we all take a break, then?

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:07.920
Today's your lucky day, Taro.

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:11.750
You sure do seem to like Kento's cooking, don't you?

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:20.840
She never grooms herself.

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:23.110
Sharpens her claws, for that matter.

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:24.560
What a strange cat.

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:25.770
Whoa!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.040
So scary.

00:13:29.770 --> 00:13:29.970
I'm sorry.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.700
Still convinced, you're Tardo's reincarnation.

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:37.630
I bet other people are feeding her too.

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:39.080
She'll get fat.

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.640
Well, I prefer chubby cats anyway.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:43.910
Obviously, they shouldn't be obese, though.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:50.890
Huh? Tardo? Are you leaving here already?

00:13:58.070 --> 00:13:59.970
Bet she has plenty of homes to go back to.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:00.160
to be continued ...

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:19.950
Tell me that Taro was here.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:22.320
I bought a treat that I wanted to give her.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.820
Hey, are you still here?

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.780
Taro, she laughed without greeting her owner.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:30.960
How rude.

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:35.130
She isn't our pet, and I found her, not you.

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:38.270
True. On that rainy festival day, right?

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:42.880
You skipped out on cram school, and our poor mother was pretty furious about it.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.740
I'll be going now.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:48.230
All right. Thanks for today.

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:49.780
Thank you for everything.

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:53.300
Shut up.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:55.080
I didn't say anything.

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:19.440
that day. Then I'll stop going. It's just a waste of money, right? I don't really care.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:24.250
I don't even want to go to cram school. I'm hanging up now.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:59.970
Huh? Day that, that I met Tata.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:14.060
Wish I didn't have to go to the bathroom in this body

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:19.040
You brown tabby

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:29.980
It's only you really should have gone to Hinode's place you would have gotten to

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.640
to spend more time with him if you had.

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:34.070
No, I haven't even wiped my butt.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:35.990
Cats don't use toilet paper.

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:38.880
We just go, it's ego friendly.

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:40.620
That is too disgusting.

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:43.180
You'll have to learn to be more open-minded.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.180
You should be enjoying living like a cat.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:48.660
This would all be such a waste if you don't.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.360
Do you relax, I'm having a-

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:52.840
Oh, really?

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.020
Well, in that case, you can keep that mask.

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.280
Just give me your human face in exchange.

00:17:58.780 --> 00:17:59.100
What?

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:01.820
You don't need it anymore, do you?

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:03.230
Not happening!

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:07.950
I sell cat masks to humans who want to be cats

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:10.930
and I sell human masks to cats who want to be humans.

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:12.340
That's my job.

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:14.290
Don't you see?

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:17.670
You have a wonderful cat life ahead of you if you keep it.

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:24.350
Wear your tiresome human face and enjoy your sweet cat life!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.490
What is his problem?

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:33.820
Enjoy your sweet cat life, please.

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:38.130
I really am rooting for you, you know.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:45.730
You should tell Hinode the truth.

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:47.750
Tell him who Taro really is.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.980
Just go up to him and say it was me, Muge, all along.

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:54.180
He'll lose that frosty attitude

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:55.860
and fall head over heels for you.

00:18:57.310 --> 00:18:59.090
There is no way I will ever do that.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:03.390
First of all, he'd never believe me, and even if he did,

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:06.460
what if it backfires and he ends up hating Taro instead?

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:10.070
I should gather more info as Taro

00:19:10.070 --> 00:19:12.710
than use what I know to get closer to him as Moogay.

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:15.550
If that's your plan, it doesn't seem to be working out.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:16.950
Quiet, quiet, quiet!

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:20.810
You know, you're really shady.

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:24.040
You don't charge anything for swapping cat and human masks.

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:26.290
So what do you get out of all this?

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:29.060
Reduce, reuse, and recycle!

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:35.520
What the?

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:47.160
Yo, you really like these, don't you?

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:53.230
Alright, now open the wide.

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:55.920
What?

00:19:58.870 --> 00:19:59.110
Ow.

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:10.580
Hey, Mio. Have some boiled potatoes. You like them, don't you?

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:13.180
Are they too bland?

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:18.560
Not at all. They're great. In fact, it's healthier this way. It tastes just like hot cuisine.

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:19.750
Really?

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:21.680
Right, Mio?

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:26.860
No, I've never had it. Kids like me prefer to have lots of meat and great flavors.

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:29.200
You'll gain weight.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:29.800
It's okay.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.680
Okay, Inore says he likes you better when I'm chubby.

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:34.600
Inore? Who's that? Your boyfriend?

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:36.470
No, no, no, no, no.

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:38.940
So I'm right. What is he like?

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:41.390
Did you know about this?

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:43.140
No, I didn't.

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:45.220
You know what? You should bring him home sometime.

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:46.850
You can introduce him to Kaoru.

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:50.750
You're both women, so you'd be more comfortable talking to her about it.

00:20:51.340 --> 00:20:53.180
Mio, you can talk to Kaoru about anything.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:56.360
Is he in the same grade? Or is he older than you?

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:58.870
And who said they liked each other first?

00:20:59.030 --> 00:20:59.970
Well, Dad, here's...

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.860
You have nothing to be shy about in this house.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:05.140
Would he just leave me alone already?

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:08.060
I know that this isn't the place where I belong.

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:15.690
I need to do whatever it takes to marry Hinode

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:18.580
and move out of here as soon as I can.

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:20.210
But in order to do that,

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:24.710
I can't let this chance slip away.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:28.630
I love him, and not just because he took me in.

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:29.900
He named me.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.820
A female cat, Taro.

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:33.960
That name was special to him.

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:36.030
It was the name of his previous dog.

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:41.950
He's so loyal, and he's smart, but he doesn't take it for granted.

00:21:43.430 --> 00:21:43.950
Taro!

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:47.790
We know what he's really like.

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:51.730
He ignores me when I'm Muge, and that makes me sad.

00:21:52.090 --> 00:21:55.750
When I'm Taro, he's so sweet to me.

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:03.540
I love you so much, Taro.

00:22:05.810 --> 00:22:08.000
Your smell is always like the sun.

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:12.250
Hinuri, actually!

00:22:14.740 --> 00:22:15.120
What's wrong?

00:22:18.320 --> 00:22:19.100
I can't do it.

00:22:19.200 --> 00:22:22.740
I have the courage to tell him that I'm really Moke.

00:22:28.850 --> 00:22:29.970
You're so lucky, Taro.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:36.640
You know what? I wish you would tell me what's wrong. Just tell me how I can help you.

00:22:36.880 --> 00:22:39.000
Oh, I have to make my lunch for tomorrow.

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:44.580
He's making his own lunchbox? Some?

00:22:49.280 --> 00:22:49.520
Some?

00:22:57.130 --> 00:22:58.090
Ugh, Mugei.

00:23:00.670 --> 00:23:02.390
It's lunchtime, then.

00:23:03.620 --> 00:23:04.640
Here's your change.

00:23:08.020 --> 00:23:10.540
My dad actually prepared my lunchbox for me today.

00:23:10.940 --> 00:23:13.280
Ooh, so you're having rice ball bombs, then?

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:14.200
Looks like it.

00:23:14.630 --> 00:23:15.510
Lucky you.

00:23:15.630 --> 00:23:16.270
Are you kidding?

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:19.790
Every time I'm forced to eat those things, I practically break my jaw.

00:23:20.110 --> 00:23:22.390
And the seaweed always ends up being soggy, too.

00:23:22.510 --> 00:23:23.790
Is ultra-gaga and eccentric?

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:26.190
That annoying barbaric she-gorilla.

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:28.660
Why is she so obsessed with Hinode lately?

00:23:29.270 --> 00:23:29.830
Who knows?

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.280
It's really starting to get on my nerves.

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:34.360
I feel sorry for Hinode.

00:23:34.780 --> 00:23:36.320
I mean, this is the movie.

00:23:36.360 --> 00:23:37.420
What's their problem?

00:23:38.820 --> 00:23:40.620
Let him talk. It's not like I care.

00:23:40.840 --> 00:23:43.820
Speaking of Hinode, he's been acting so smug lately.

00:23:43.960 --> 00:23:44.480
You think so?

00:23:45.140 --> 00:23:46.620
Yeah, like he's better than us.

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:47.220
What?

00:23:48.140 --> 00:23:49.780
His grade shot up out of nowhere.

00:23:50.020 --> 00:23:51.380
It just doesn't make any sense.

00:23:51.760 --> 00:23:53.460
He must have cheated on the tests.

00:23:55.320 --> 00:23:58.180
Muge, what are you gonna do?

00:23:58.380 --> 00:23:59.640
I can't wait to eat.

00:24:00.350 --> 00:24:05.800
Don't! You have to calm down! Muge! Someone's-

00:24:07.260 --> 00:24:10.590
What did you just say about Hinode? You better take it back!

00:24:10.890 --> 00:24:12.370
Huh? What are you doing?

00:24:12.690 --> 00:24:13.050
Muge!

00:24:17.620 --> 00:24:28.540
What is wrong with you?

00:24:29.280 --> 00:24:29.980
Man, this is-

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:31.440
It's so much easier when I'm a cat.

00:24:31.640 --> 00:24:32.000
Yeah.

00:24:33.440 --> 00:24:34.820
Are you insane?

00:24:34.980 --> 00:24:35.720
What's your problem?

00:24:36.230 --> 00:24:38.150
That's exactly what I was going to ask you.

00:24:38.450 --> 00:24:38.790
What?

00:24:39.370 --> 00:24:43.460
You have no idea how hard he works.

00:24:44.050 --> 00:24:46.190
The two of you better stop lying about him,

00:24:46.330 --> 00:24:47.250
or else I'm going to...

00:24:49.000 --> 00:24:49.960
Hey, are you all right?

00:24:52.070 --> 00:24:53.270
Are you all right?

00:24:55.960 --> 00:24:56.920
Hey, let's go.

00:24:57.410 --> 00:24:59.900
Yeah, I'm totally fine.

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:02.100
actually. Were you worried about me?

00:25:03.160 --> 00:25:04.360
You should go to the nurse.

00:25:05.010 --> 00:25:07.290
No, it's nothing, really. I'm fine.

00:25:07.470 --> 00:25:14.880
Let's go. Okay. You don't

00:25:14.880 --> 00:25:16.740
have to do that. I'll clean it up myself.

00:25:17.040 --> 00:25:29.790
You can have half of my lunch. Wait, boiled?

00:25:30.120 --> 00:25:30.900
Sweet potatoes?

00:25:31.740 --> 00:25:33.280
I didn't even know you could cook.

00:25:33.810 --> 00:25:35.050
You made all that yourself?

00:25:35.350 --> 00:25:36.110
Yeah, I did.

00:25:36.760 --> 00:25:38.320
That's seriously impressive.

00:25:38.560 --> 00:25:39.660
My dad can learn a thing or two from you.

00:25:39.950 --> 00:25:40.710
Look at that color.

00:25:41.410 --> 00:25:42.390
Look at that shine.

00:25:42.670 --> 00:25:45.570
Are you complaining?

00:25:46.510 --> 00:25:48.190
No, that was a compliment.

00:25:48.430 --> 00:25:50.220
The way my mom makes it.

00:25:50.810 --> 00:25:53.630
You really should have just ignored those two, you know?

00:25:53.810 --> 00:25:54.730
Yeah, agreed.

00:25:55.280 --> 00:25:57.040
They can say whatever they want about me.

00:25:58.060 --> 00:25:59.140
We want to come see you.

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:01.300
It doesn't put you down like that.

00:26:02.120 --> 00:26:04.910
Mmm, these boiled potatoes are delicious!

00:26:05.550 --> 00:26:05.970
Mm-hmm!

00:26:08.460 --> 00:26:08.640
Huh?

00:26:10.070 --> 00:26:10.550
Hey!

00:26:10.830 --> 00:26:11.350
What are you doing?

00:26:22.090 --> 00:26:22.570
Salty?

00:26:22.710 --> 00:26:24.030
Shouldn't you have said tasty?

00:26:24.290 --> 00:26:25.190
You think they're really salty?

00:26:25.410 --> 00:26:26.070
That's all?

00:26:26.330 --> 00:26:26.610
Yeah.

00:26:27.340 --> 00:26:27.520
Right.

00:26:29.110 --> 00:26:29.930
Knock it off!

00:26:30.640 --> 00:26:32.120
Pretty sure once was enough, all right.

00:26:32.400 --> 00:26:32.960
You think?

00:26:39.700 --> 00:26:42.320
Muge, I bet his rice is salty, too.

00:26:42.660 --> 00:26:43.660
Hey, shut up.

00:26:44.960 --> 00:26:47.950
Did I just make Kinode laugh?

00:26:48.150 --> 00:26:50.010
Don't go jumping off buildings again, okay?

00:26:50.530 --> 00:26:52.270
You do know you're a human, not a cat.

00:26:57.780 --> 00:26:59.140
She has the same scent.

00:26:59.530 --> 00:26:59.870
Eat up!

00:27:02.020 --> 00:27:04.140
I can feed myself.

00:27:28.130 --> 00:27:29.970
Open the door and...

00:27:30.190 --> 00:27:41.370
there we go oh welcome home thank you what happened to your leg are you hurt oh no don't

00:27:41.370 --> 00:27:51.290
worry it's just a scratch but no really it's fine rocks in the sink hmm onions that means we're

00:27:51.290 --> 00:27:59.250
having curry or maybe meat and potato did something happen you seem to be in a good mood nothing at all

00:27:59.250 --> 00:27:59.930
Just a no

00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:00.340
I'm okay.

00:28:30.410 --> 00:28:31.630
You wanna see him laugh again?

00:28:33.600 --> 00:28:34.120
Ding!

00:29:16.670 --> 00:29:17.610
He isn't home yet.

00:29:19.110 --> 00:29:19.530
