00:29:20.640 --> 00:29:22.500
We can't afford to keep the studio anymore.

00:29:22.900 --> 00:29:24.080
It's just too expensive.

00:29:24.440 --> 00:29:29.350
To be honest with you, at this rate, we won't be able to pay Mr. Sakaguchi his salary.

00:29:29.760 --> 00:29:29.980
But-

00:29:30.670 --> 00:29:31.850
Grandpa can continue working.

00:29:31.870 --> 00:29:33.170
Don't you be selfish now.

00:29:33.710 --> 00:29:35.430
His eyesight is getting worse anyway.

00:29:36.240 --> 00:29:39.580
I wanted to keep working, but she's right.

00:29:39.980 --> 00:29:41.080
Are you sure about this?

00:29:42.680 --> 00:29:44.240
I'm very sorry, Kento.

00:29:45.090 --> 00:29:47.390
You should be focusing on your entrance exams.

00:29:47.810 --> 00:29:50.790
If you want to use the kiln again, make sure you do it soon.

00:29:54.520 --> 00:29:55.620
Are we shutting down the studio?

00:29:56.270 --> 00:29:56.930
Yes, we are.

00:29:56.950 --> 00:29:58.530
What about Mr. Sakaguchi, though?

00:29:58.790 --> 00:29:59.470
He'll be quitting.

00:30:01.110 --> 00:30:03.130
Wait, I might have a good idea.

00:30:03.440 --> 00:30:06.800
What if we had Mr. Sakaguchi start his very own pottery class?

00:30:07.080 --> 00:30:09.680
There are already too many pottery classes in this town.

00:30:09.960 --> 00:30:10.660
That wouldn't help.

00:30:10.990 --> 00:30:11.250
What?

00:30:11.680 --> 00:30:15.080
All the girls in town will totally be interested if he's the instructor.

00:30:15.360 --> 00:30:17.000
Well, I know I would join the class.

00:30:17.140 --> 00:30:17.520
Sorry.

00:30:17.860 --> 00:30:18.640
But why?

00:30:38.730 --> 00:30:53.080
You know they sweet and sour pork is really good you think so isn't it the key is the onions they make or break this dish

00:30:53.240 --> 00:30:59.820
It doesn't taste so good. The flavor is strong

00:31:00.120 --> 00:31:00.980
Just the way you like it.

00:31:01.000 --> 00:31:02.460
I'm really glad you're enjoying it.

00:31:11.720 --> 00:31:14.350
Hinode, he looked so sad.

00:31:15.160 --> 00:31:16.040
Can't help him.

00:31:16.440 --> 00:31:18.060
Not his mugae or his taro.

00:31:18.550 --> 00:31:20.150
The sweet and sour pork was good.

00:31:20.420 --> 00:31:21.840
I hate this so much.

00:31:22.380 --> 00:31:23.360
It's not fair.

00:32:03.740 --> 00:32:05.850
Huh? Did you injure your leg?

00:32:08.480 --> 00:32:12.100
Oh, poor girl. You okay?

00:32:12.440 --> 00:32:16.530
Just like her injury.

00:32:24.020 --> 00:32:26.640
Truth is, I wish I were able to speak my mind like her.

00:32:27.720 --> 00:32:29.160
I want to continue doing pottery.

00:32:31.210 --> 00:32:33.830
I know that the studio isn't doing so well right now,

00:32:34.790 --> 00:32:37.060
but I want to tell them I'll be in charge of it.

00:32:38.080 --> 00:32:41.600
Except I'm not that confident myself, so I didn't say anything.

00:32:43.560 --> 00:32:45.140
I don't know how Grandpa does it.

00:32:46.140 --> 00:32:49.660
In his hands, ordinary clay turns into all kinds of shapes and colors.

00:32:50.760 --> 00:32:55.320
I've always wanted to be like him, but again, I couldn't say it out loud.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:01.040
She would have said it though.

00:33:02.560 --> 00:33:04.940
If Muge were in my shoes, I know she would have.

00:33:05.480 --> 00:33:07.910
Hinore, just like you,

00:33:09.020 --> 00:33:11.420
can't say the things I really want to either.

00:33:14.680 --> 00:33:19.760
Amazing, Hinore, to wish that the world would end.

00:33:19.880 --> 00:33:21.040
I've wished it every day.

00:33:21.970 --> 00:33:26.690
But after meeting you and in love with you,

00:33:27.330 --> 00:33:29.980
the whole world just seems so beautiful to me.

00:33:31.690 --> 00:33:32.950
All I want to do is help you.

00:33:33.130 --> 00:33:37.280
I want to hear you say that I love you.

00:33:49.770 --> 00:33:50.930
Keep studying pottery.

00:33:51.920 --> 00:33:54.260
There's nothing special about my creations right now.

00:33:54.420 --> 00:33:57.600
I also have to go to Tonomori High School.

00:34:00.410 --> 00:34:06.350
But for starters, I have to tell mom about my plans.

00:34:08.330 --> 00:34:09.170
Let's go, Taro.

00:34:34.040 --> 00:34:41.940
so did you end up telling him the truth snot I see clearly never going to tell

00:34:41.940 --> 00:34:55.360
him at this rate so why don't you stay a cat forever do anything for him yes well

00:34:55.360 --> 00:34:57.260
you can't help him as a human either

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:05.000
Not right? Not right? Are you sure, dear?

00:35:06.000 --> 00:35:09.820
If you stay as a cat, you would be able to stay close to Hinode.

00:35:10.160 --> 00:35:13.680
You'll be able to observe him, then sleep, have him feed you,

00:35:13.800 --> 00:35:15.960
then sleep, poop, then sleep some more.

00:35:16.180 --> 00:35:17.380
Isn't that just great?

00:35:17.740 --> 00:35:19.480
Hinode would be so happy.

00:35:31.820 --> 00:35:35.260
The world is filled with so many things that I hate and things that I don't need.

00:35:37.450 --> 00:35:40.030
If those things aren't around when my time here is finally over,

00:35:41.380 --> 00:35:43.370
well, I guess I wouldn't want it to be like that.

00:35:46.440 --> 00:35:47.420
I wouldn't want that.

00:35:47.990 --> 00:35:48.490
That's all.

00:35:49.480 --> 00:35:49.660
Huh?

00:35:52.260 --> 00:35:53.320
You're tickling me.

00:36:00.320 --> 00:36:00.580
Right.

00:36:16.220 --> 00:36:16.340
Yo.

00:36:24.420 --> 00:36:25.000
They're still here.

00:36:25.670 --> 00:36:26.830
They must have gone out the window.

00:36:26.830 --> 00:36:27.110
This hour?

00:36:27.380 --> 00:36:28.120
Without shoes on?

00:36:28.260 --> 00:36:28.700
Oh shoot!

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:39.860
out of her room lately hmm what do we do i don't feel right scolding her yeah i know how you feel

00:36:45.160 --> 00:36:57.700
mio mio did you go out somewhere huh i went to your room to see if you wanted to have tea together

00:36:57.700 --> 00:36:58.960
but you weren't there oh

00:37:00.410 --> 00:37:03.470
Was... I was up on the roof.

00:37:04.180 --> 00:37:04.300
What?

00:37:05.100 --> 00:37:07.960
Sometimes just really want to feel the windows, you know?

00:37:11.450 --> 00:37:12.110
Good night, dear.

00:37:17.540 --> 00:37:19.200
Hinode's sunrise is...

00:37:19.320 --> 00:37:21.840
I don't want to use meaningless words to protect myself.

00:37:22.390 --> 00:37:24.010
Even if he gets upset about it,

00:37:24.150 --> 00:37:26.170
I'd rather have Hinode's honesty instead.

00:37:27.380 --> 00:37:28.380
That's not right.

00:37:30.440 --> 00:37:36.780
Oh, it's Mio Sazaki.

00:37:37.750 --> 00:37:38.910
Mio Hinore.

00:37:39.910 --> 00:37:40.870
Mio Hinore.

00:37:53.780 --> 00:37:55.140
Did you stay up late studying?

00:37:55.680 --> 00:37:57.780
No, I was actually thinking about my life.

00:37:58.740 --> 00:37:59.180
Morning!

00:37:59.480 --> 00:37:59.700
Hey, guys.

00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:00.260
Hey!

00:38:02.030 --> 00:38:03.670
Good morning!

00:38:04.580 --> 00:38:05.160
Hey you guys!

00:38:05.420 --> 00:38:05.680
Good morning!

00:38:09.840 --> 00:38:10.480
What is it?

00:38:11.040 --> 00:38:11.360
Huh?

00:38:12.000 --> 00:38:18.520
What is she gonna do now?

00:38:19.180 --> 00:38:19.980
Hey, Hinori!

00:38:20.650 --> 00:38:21.070
What's up?

00:38:23.450 --> 00:38:24.630
I wanted to give you this!

00:38:25.110 --> 00:38:29.830
Is that a letter?

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:32.020
I see there in your hands, Ms. Mugay?

00:38:32.590 --> 00:38:34.070
This is none of your business!

00:38:36.760 --> 00:38:37.200
Hey!

00:38:37.440 --> 00:38:38.440
Is it a love letter?

00:38:39.400 --> 00:38:39.840
Stop!

00:38:41.210 --> 00:38:42.210
Ms. Mugay!

00:38:42.310 --> 00:38:43.110
Ms. Mugay!

00:38:43.230 --> 00:38:44.810
I got your letter over here!

00:38:46.380 --> 00:38:47.060
Confession time!

00:38:47.480 --> 00:38:48.360
Would you knock it off?

00:38:48.540 --> 00:38:51.100
How about I read it out loud for everyone to hear?

00:38:51.840 --> 00:38:53.320
Da-da-da-da-da!

00:38:53.840 --> 00:38:54.200
Haha!

00:38:55.000 --> 00:38:56.560
You guys really need to cut it out!

00:38:56.740 --> 00:38:58.500
Hey, Bonnie, are you really gonna read it?

00:38:59.030 --> 00:38:59.250
Ha!

00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:02.040
How pathetic can you be?

00:39:02.840 --> 00:39:03.620
Here goes.

00:39:04.450 --> 00:39:06.450
Hinode, any time that I see you,

00:39:06.660 --> 00:39:07.920
I just feel so happy.

00:39:08.060 --> 00:39:08.620
Aren't I?

00:39:08.760 --> 00:39:10.500
You see, the name Hinode Sunrise

00:39:10.500 --> 00:39:12.680
isn't just some random phrase I came up with.

00:39:12.940 --> 00:39:14.200
Give it back!

00:39:14.480 --> 00:39:17.560
In fact, it's actually how I feel about you.

00:39:17.740 --> 00:39:19.360
You are my sunrise.

00:39:19.360 --> 00:39:21.420
This letter isn't for you. Give it back, you jerk!

00:39:21.640 --> 00:39:25.620
Hinode Sunrise is when the sun rises above the horizon.

00:39:26.100 --> 00:39:28.120
That moment that warms my soul.

00:39:28.220 --> 00:39:28.500
Give it back!

00:39:30.120 --> 00:39:31.420
Why are you so desperate?

00:39:32.360 --> 00:39:35.160
Too embarrassing for you!

00:39:35.380 --> 00:39:36.640
Why should I be embarrassed?

00:39:37.170 --> 00:39:40.150
You have absolutely no right to be making fun of my feelings!

00:39:42.780 --> 00:39:44.940
So, you gonna accept it?

00:39:45.230 --> 00:39:46.930
This love confession of hers?

00:39:47.620 --> 00:39:49.380
Mr. Sunrise?

00:39:52.950 --> 00:39:53.590
You know that...

00:40:04.090 --> 00:40:04.550
What's wrong?

00:40:06.740 --> 00:40:08.840
Confession time! Confession time! Confession time!

00:40:08.840 --> 00:40:09.220
Confession time!

00:40:09.480 --> 00:40:09.680
Oh!

00:40:11.700 --> 00:40:14.580
You know what? I... I just wanted to cheer you up.

00:40:14.620 --> 00:40:15.340
Oh, no help here.

00:40:15.520 --> 00:40:17.620
You see, we... you and I are the same.

00:40:18.420 --> 00:40:20.080
The things that I truly feel...

00:40:20.080 --> 00:40:21.860
Just stop it! And you're wrong!

00:40:22.160 --> 00:40:23.160
We're nothing alike!

00:40:25.140 --> 00:40:26.260
It's really embarrassed me.

00:40:27.350 --> 00:40:29.130
Have you considered my feelings at all?

00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:30.960
I just heard this.

00:40:31.780 --> 00:40:34.990
I seriously hate pushy people like you.

00:40:35.190 --> 00:40:38.270
What if I told you in person?

00:40:38.390 --> 00:40:39.290
Just leave me alone!

00:40:39.570 --> 00:40:40.490
Didn't you hear me?

00:40:41.200 --> 00:40:42.680
I said that I hate you!

00:40:48.920 --> 00:40:52.980
Oh, I see.

00:40:54.180 --> 00:40:59.980
You hate...

00:41:00.410 --> 00:41:21.890
much huh okay well then this is bad i guess told you to give up on him pretty sure i should be the

00:41:21.890 --> 00:41:27.170
one crying right now listen to me you have to forget about him

00:41:30.320 --> 00:41:32.720
It can't be-

00:41:32.720 --> 00:41:33.960
I don't want that to happen.

00:41:37.810 --> 00:41:38.210
Yori?

00:41:45.900 --> 00:41:46.300
Mio?

00:41:47.110 --> 00:41:47.650
Are you there?

00:41:48.640 --> 00:41:49.740
Yeah, I'm here.

00:41:50.180 --> 00:41:51.100
Would you like some tea?

00:41:53.220 --> 00:41:54.540
No, thank you though.

00:41:56.310 --> 00:41:56.970
Can I come in?

00:41:57.250 --> 00:41:57.390
What?

00:41:59.200 --> 00:41:59.440
What?

00:42:01.020 --> 00:42:12.180
I'm trying to lose weight.

00:42:13.770 --> 00:42:18.490
Mio, do I make you uncomfortable?

00:42:18.890 --> 00:42:21.950
I mean, is this a soap opera now or something?

00:42:24.690 --> 00:42:27.830
Why are you laughing like that?

00:42:28.140 --> 00:42:29.800
You always do that, and I don't understand.

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:33.740
And why? Are you trying to force yourself to be someone you're not?

00:42:34.810 --> 00:42:37.070
Well, listen, Mio. I was thinking that we-

00:42:37.070 --> 00:42:37.490
So selfish.

00:42:38.120 --> 00:42:39.700
Huh? Excuse me?

00:42:39.860 --> 00:42:42.300
You are all so selfish. So se-

00:42:44.940 --> 00:42:45.160
Mio?

00:42:52.020 --> 00:42:53.220
Because I want to!

00:42:54.160 --> 00:42:55.840
Mother, are you serious?

00:42:56.570 --> 00:42:59.850
You and dad knew perfectly well I was never going to be happy about this!

00:43:00.570 --> 00:43:02.570
I've been doing my best to live peacefully

00:43:02.570 --> 00:43:04.110
with you in this house, haven't I?

00:43:04.730 --> 00:43:05.530
Now what?

00:43:06.060 --> 00:43:08.660
Now do you want me to stop laughing if it's not real?

00:43:08.960 --> 00:43:11.330
It is all about what you want to do.

00:43:14.040 --> 00:43:14.800
Pardon on mom.

00:43:15.060 --> 00:43:18.690
She walked out of my life and completely abandoned me.

00:43:18.870 --> 00:43:21.410
And now she says she wants to live with me?

00:43:21.670 --> 00:43:25.710
The truth is I don't care about mom or dad or you.

00:43:25.990 --> 00:43:27.870
I really couldn't care less.

00:43:28.680 --> 00:43:29.960
I don't need any of you.

00:43:30.090 --> 00:43:30.270
No!

00:43:40.340 --> 00:43:40.960
Let's go!

00:43:44.050 --> 00:43:44.430
Nio!

00:43:49.960 --> 00:43:50.380
They're in

00:43:51.720 --> 00:43:52.060
God

00:43:54.770 --> 00:43:55.350
Mom

00:43:56.880 --> 00:43:57.260
They're

00:43:57.570 --> 00:43:58.770
They all hate me

00:43:59.660 --> 00:43:59.980
Does it?

00:44:01.180 --> 00:44:04.120
He knew that I... is all I need.

00:44:08.500 --> 00:44:23.780
But he was right about me after all.

00:44:25.310 --> 00:44:28.860
He didn't mean anything when he shared his lunch with me.

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:32.200
And I get excited and wrote a letter.

00:44:32.440 --> 00:44:43.270
I don't like you.

00:44:54.900 --> 00:44:58.360
You know what a sunrise is when the sun rises above the horizon.

00:45:00.380 --> 00:45:07.300
Warms my soul when I'm with you feel warm and fuzzy inside. I know other people feel the same way too

00:45:07.300 --> 00:45:09.120
Even if things don't go your way

00:45:09.120 --> 00:45:10.560
I just wanted to cheer you up

00:45:10.870 --> 00:45:18.460
You and I can't say the things that I truly feel those words. I wonder why she said that to me

00:45:18.460 --> 00:45:27.460
I never told her she couldn't know about my problems. Yeah, isn't this a little late for you

00:45:31.880 --> 00:45:33.120
You know that plate you stepped on?

00:45:33.350 --> 00:45:34.940
Well, you left a paw print.

00:45:37.100 --> 00:45:37.940
It actually helped.

00:45:38.840 --> 00:45:40.420
Grandpa seemed to be impressed with it.

00:45:42.390 --> 00:45:44.250
She thinks I'm like her, but is she right?

00:45:44.860 --> 00:45:45.180
No.

00:46:04.860 --> 00:46:08.670
Scent of the sun, just like her scent.

00:46:11.120 --> 00:46:15.120
She didn't seem like the type to have trouble expressing herself.

00:46:30.830 --> 00:46:31.430
I love you.

00:46:39.100 --> 00:46:39.540
See it.

00:46:42.690 --> 00:46:43.050
Love you.

00:46:58.290 --> 00:46:59.970
So, if I was to-

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:03.170
Haro, then he would finally love

00:47:03.170 --> 00:47:06.090
me? Inore Sunrise.

00:47:06.210 --> 00:47:10.240
This was always my dream. See the

00:47:10.240 --> 00:47:12.040
sunrise with Inore.

00:47:30.060 --> 00:47:31.180
This is Hinode's house.

00:47:35.240 --> 00:47:36.220
I'm gonna be late for school.

00:47:36.680 --> 00:47:38.550
Oh yeah, I'm a cat.

00:47:39.150 --> 00:47:40.410
I don't have to go to school.

00:47:43.360 --> 00:47:43.840
Hi.

00:47:46.780 --> 00:47:48.820
Everything's better when you're a cat, you know.

00:47:49.060 --> 00:47:51.080
It's all sunshine and rainbows.

00:47:51.280 --> 00:47:53.600
I'm a cat, so you can take my word for it.

00:47:53.720 --> 00:47:54.700
I wouldn't lie.

00:47:57.120 --> 00:47:57.640
I'm done.

00:47:58.370 --> 00:47:59.720
With what?

00:48:00.120 --> 00:48:02.120
With being... Mio.

00:48:03.400 --> 00:48:04.900
Oh, is that right?

00:48:05.960 --> 00:48:06.920
Very good.

00:48:07.870 --> 00:48:08.410
I'm done.

00:48:14.430 --> 00:48:14.810
Wonderful!

00:48:18.180 --> 00:48:19.440
Ah, thank you.

00:48:21.010 --> 00:48:21.350
But...

00:48:21.820 --> 00:48:23.440
Your face, of course.

00:48:24.190 --> 00:48:27.150
It comes off when you're sure you don't want to be human anymore.

00:48:27.820 --> 00:48:29.020
You'll stay as a cat now.

00:48:29.060 --> 00:48:29.460
But...

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:31.300
I can't go back to being human?

00:48:31.610 --> 00:48:33.290
Well, actually, you can.

00:48:34.320 --> 00:48:36.940
If you were to put this mask back on, that is.

00:48:38.100 --> 00:48:40.520
Although the only problem is you would have to do it

00:48:40.520 --> 00:48:42.180
before you turn into a real cat.

00:48:42.610 --> 00:48:44.390
Your transformation will take a while,

00:48:44.430 --> 00:48:47.370
but when it happens, we can go out to celebrate.

00:48:48.040 --> 00:48:48.440
Hmm?

00:48:49.380 --> 00:48:49.640
Wait!

00:49:01.310 --> 00:49:01.870
Okay.

00:49:05.680 --> 00:49:07.360
Fukase, Hinode, come with me.

00:49:09.770 --> 00:49:10.570
She ran away?

00:49:11.190 --> 00:49:12.290
Did you know about it?

00:49:13.150 --> 00:49:13.530
No.

00:49:14.120 --> 00:49:14.880
Are you Hinode?

00:49:16.290 --> 00:49:16.650
Yes.

00:49:17.330 --> 00:49:18.630
Are you going out with Mio?

00:49:19.060 --> 00:49:19.520
Huh?

00:49:20.180 --> 00:49:22.600
It's just that Mio had mentioned your name once before.

00:49:23.000 --> 00:49:24.840
Did she go to your house last night?

00:49:25.020 --> 00:49:25.560
Was she there?

00:49:26.100 --> 00:49:26.580
No.

00:49:26.800 --> 00:49:27.820
Please, tell us the truth.

00:49:28.640 --> 00:49:29.560
We won't get angry.

00:49:30.280 --> 00:49:32.000
They're not a couple. He's not lying.

00:49:32.430 --> 00:49:36.460
Yes, but Mio has been sneaking out of her room every day, so we thought...

00:49:36.460 --> 00:49:37.240
They're not a couple, okay?

00:49:37.820 --> 00:49:40.280
I would know. I walk home with Mugei every day.

00:49:40.870 --> 00:49:44.520
All right, then if you know where she is, will you please tell us?

00:49:45.020 --> 00:49:50.790
But I don't know. If I did, then maybe I wouldn't be such a useless friend.

00:49:54.400 --> 00:49:55.680
If you'll excuse us.

00:49:55.960 --> 00:49:56.360
Thank you.

00:50:01.820 --> 00:50:04.240
What did they want? Does it have to do with Mugei?

00:50:04.560 --> 00:50:06.960
Yeah, she ran away from home.

00:50:07.120 --> 00:50:11.370
Really? I bet it was Bana and Niibori. They must have gotten under her skin.

00:50:11.630 --> 00:50:12.290
Not so sure.

00:50:12.630 --> 00:50:16.170
She would never run away from home. Not because of losers like them.

00:50:16.580 --> 00:50:20.810
You think so? Oh, you've been her best friend since grade school, haven't you?

00:50:21.400 --> 00:50:24.400
She's always been Miss Ultra Gaga and eccentric to us.

00:50:24.620 --> 00:50:26.400
But not you. You understand her.

00:50:28.100 --> 00:50:29.980
Hey, I think I'm gonna go try to find...

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:49.500
what right now he saw me tell the teachers that I'm going I see I didn't

00:50:49.500 --> 00:50:54.260
know about her family situation when she was in grade school her mother walked

00:50:54.260 --> 00:50:58.880
out on her our classmates started ignoring her because of that I was her

00:50:58.880 --> 00:50:59.980
close friend through it all.

00:51:00.410 --> 00:51:03.110
And I was the only one who remained friends with her after.

00:51:03.580 --> 00:51:05.780
But she didn't want them to bully me, so...

00:51:06.340 --> 00:51:08.780
Yeah, I guess stuff like that happens.

00:51:09.120 --> 00:51:10.320
Yeah, well, it shouldn't.

00:51:14.530 --> 00:51:18.030
Yoriko said she's going to walk home with us today, right?

00:51:18.890 --> 00:51:22.250
She said she doesn't need you, Miss Ultra Gaga and Eccentric.

00:51:22.510 --> 00:51:24.930
Yeah, your mom probably said the same thing to you.

00:51:25.420 --> 00:51:26.360
Let's go, Yori.

00:52:02.610 --> 00:52:03.650
Here?

00:52:34.280 --> 00:52:57.500
That's when I realized Muge always puts on a brave face.

00:52:58.100 --> 00:52:59.480
She pretends she's all right.

00:53:00.090 --> 00:53:02.220
Even when she's hurting inside.

00:53:04.730 --> 00:53:07.600
Hey, did you mean it when you told Muge you hated her?

00:53:09.000 --> 00:53:12.010
If you meant what you said, I want you to ignore Muge.

00:53:14.770 --> 00:53:16.110
Don't let her get her hopes up.

00:53:18.130 --> 00:53:18.750
Well, I...

00:53:21.340 --> 00:53:21.540
Thing.

00:53:22.540 --> 00:53:22.680
Huh?

00:53:23.610 --> 00:53:24.410
I need to be sure.

00:53:24.790 --> 00:53:25.970
Do you actually like Muge?

00:53:26.360 --> 00:53:29.980
If you do, she has to be the first one to hear it.

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:30.620
not me

00:53:32.530 --> 00:53:33.170
well

00:53:34.090 --> 00:53:35.860
to say I hate her

00:53:36.100 --> 00:53:37.340
that wouldn't be true

00:53:37.340 --> 00:53:38.380
noticed

00:53:52.810 --> 00:53:54.050
her friend

00:53:54.050 --> 00:53:54.890
called Mio

00:53:55.360 --> 00:53:56.080
Muge

00:53:56.080 --> 00:53:57.410
that's right

00:53:57.410 --> 00:53:59.270
it's kind of their nickname for it

00:53:59.460 --> 00:53:59.980
I really

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:11.560
Lily had no idea. Does her mother know what's going on? What's the matter?

00:54:12.410 --> 00:54:13.410
She's coming over.

00:54:16.780 --> 00:54:27.570
Wait, Mom's due to get her a smartphone, didn't I?

00:54:30.600 --> 00:54:33.160
Tell me one thing. Why did you go to her school?

00:54:33.620 --> 00:54:37.160
Have you thought about what her classmates may say about the two of you showing up there?

00:54:37.460 --> 00:54:40.520
We figured her friends might know something that could help us find her.

00:54:40.780 --> 00:54:42.460
Well, couldn't you have just called them then?

00:54:43.460 --> 00:54:45.140
Would you have known where to start?

00:54:45.460 --> 00:54:46.780
Do you even know who they are?

00:54:47.080 --> 00:54:48.060
Actually, I don't.

00:54:48.280 --> 00:54:49.260
Yeah, some father.

00:54:50.350 --> 00:54:53.150
Miss Miki, may I ask something? Did she go to your place?

00:54:53.420 --> 00:54:54.300
What does that mean?

00:54:55.120 --> 00:54:56.540
Just that Mio is...

00:54:56.540 --> 00:54:59.700
She can't be honest around you. She's too kind for that.

00:55:00.600 --> 00:55:01.960
But what concern is that of yours?

00:55:02.550 --> 00:55:05.630
You forced yourself into her life and into this family.

00:55:05.790 --> 00:55:07.430
You obviously wouldn't understand.

00:55:07.810 --> 00:55:12.940
And I ask you, did you take the time to think about her feelings when you abandoned her?

00:55:14.700 --> 00:55:17.300
Don't you know how much pain you've caused her?

00:55:20.300 --> 00:55:21.460
What was that for?

00:55:21.720 --> 00:55:23.600
I want to be her brother again!

00:55:23.640 --> 00:55:24.200
Knock it off!

00:55:24.700 --> 00:55:25.260
She's such a distant way!

00:55:27.400 --> 00:55:28.260
She's so happy!

00:55:28.400 --> 00:55:29.200
I'm happy!

00:55:30.950 --> 00:55:39.570
This isn't the best time to say goodbye.

00:55:42.580 --> 00:55:42.940
Okay.

00:55:45.360 --> 00:55:45.780
For you.

00:56:01.180 --> 00:56:01.660
Yori?

00:56:04.320 --> 00:56:06.120
Kukase, I've looked all over for you.

00:56:06.460 --> 00:56:07.060
I'm sorry.

00:56:08.000 --> 00:56:09.160
Well, did you find Sasaki?

00:56:09.760 --> 00:56:10.060
No.

00:56:10.900 --> 00:56:11.240
I see.

00:56:11.760 --> 00:56:13.500
All right, we'll let her parents handle it.

00:56:13.800 --> 00:56:14.720
Let's go back to school.

00:56:15.430 --> 00:56:15.930
Yes, sir.

00:56:16.580 --> 00:56:17.320
Where's Hinode?

00:56:17.950 --> 00:56:19.910
He went to the train station to look for me.

00:56:20.130 --> 00:56:22.130
Wait, Hinode is looking for me?

00:56:26.220 --> 00:56:26.620
Really?

00:56:29.040 --> 00:56:29.780
That's all we know.

00:56:30.510 --> 00:56:33.470
I know you're all worried about her, but please leave this to the adults.

00:56:40.420 --> 00:56:42.100
Kento should be back soon.

00:56:44.570 --> 00:56:48.960
You must really like him if you came to wait for him.

00:56:51.970 --> 00:56:56.610
Catch that, Grandpa. Could you repeat that?

00:56:57.400 --> 00:56:59.970
Huh? Sorry, little one. I don't know...

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:00.820
what to feed you.

00:57:01.390 --> 00:57:02.190
I'm home, Grandpa.

00:57:02.630 --> 00:57:05.070
Huh? Oh, good.

00:57:05.270 --> 00:57:06.330
Mom isn't back yet, right?

00:57:07.840 --> 00:57:09.290
Taro, what are you doing here?

00:57:10.540 --> 00:57:13.460
Oh, listen, I have to go out again, Grandpa.

00:57:13.860 --> 00:57:14.980
Could you cover for me with Mom?

00:57:15.310 --> 00:57:16.190
Ah, sure.

00:57:18.840 --> 00:57:24.600
OK, Taro, maybe you can help me find her.

00:57:49.710 --> 00:57:50.950
Where could she have even gone to?

00:57:52.390 --> 00:57:56.740
Wait, is everyone I know really looking for me?

00:58:01.050 --> 00:58:12.420
Ruth doesn't know anything about her.

00:58:13.740 --> 00:58:15.500
Does she usually go to spend her time?

00:58:16.720 --> 00:58:18.460
Does she laugh on her mind?

00:58:20.400 --> 00:58:22.200
I had no idea what she was going through.

00:58:23.900 --> 00:58:27.890
I mean, she was always smiling and laughing.

00:58:28.800 --> 00:58:29.580
It all for me.

00:58:32.240 --> 00:58:36.800
Compared to me, she is amazing and just so much stronger than I am.

00:58:42.960 --> 00:58:47.090
Afraid she would see me for- for who I really am, a nobody.

00:58:48.630 --> 00:58:49.110
Hinode!

00:58:50.210 --> 00:58:56.110
To apologize to her, then she would- she would come back, right?

00:58:57.080 --> 00:58:59.900
Hinode, her amazing, you know that?

00:59:00.920 --> 00:59:06.220
You care about your family, you're loyal to your friends, you're gentle with animals.

00:59:08.290 --> 00:59:10.530
I-Piu.

00:59:11.870 --> 00:59:12.330
Moga.

00:59:13.010 --> 00:59:13.410
Yes?

00:59:13.530 --> 00:59:17.270
You should've been nicer to her.

00:59:22.370 --> 00:59:22.890
Let her-

00:59:26.920 --> 00:59:28.700
I don't understand what he's saying.

00:59:31.340 --> 00:59:33.480
So I really am turning into a cat.

00:59:36.790 --> 00:59:36.990
Stop.

00:59:39.100 --> 00:59:40.540
Should have told him to forget about me

00:59:40.820 --> 00:59:42.580
before turning into a cat

00:59:42.580 --> 00:59:48.110
to go back to being a human.

00:59:52.690 --> 00:59:53.690
Good morning!

00:59:54.400 --> 00:59:55.140
Oh, morning.

01:00:03.040 --> 01:00:05.470
Hey! Good morning!

01:00:06.910 --> 01:00:07.230
Good morning.

01:00:09.510 --> 01:00:14.630
It's been three days since she returned, and she hasn't done a single sunrise attack.

01:00:15.600 --> 01:00:15.800
Hmm.

01:00:16.980 --> 01:00:18.320
Something strange with her.

01:00:19.130 --> 01:00:22.150
Do you think she might still be upset over that thing with the letter?

01:00:23.100 --> 01:00:24.640
You apologized to her, right?

01:00:25.140 --> 01:00:25.460
Yeah.

01:00:30.060 --> 01:00:30.840
It's so cute!

01:00:31.860 --> 01:00:32.900
Where'd you come from?

01:00:33.000 --> 01:00:34.370
I've seen it around town!

01:00:35.880 --> 01:00:36.640
Look at those eyes!

01:00:36.880 --> 01:00:37.640
Come here, kitty!

01:00:38.000 --> 01:00:38.200
Aww!

01:00:43.830 --> 01:00:44.290
Trouble.

01:00:46.040 --> 01:00:49.440
Add ING to a verb and you get a gerund.

01:00:52.680 --> 01:00:53.220
Sazaki.

01:00:53.480 --> 01:00:54.880
What does the first example say?

01:00:55.670 --> 01:00:56.210
Sazaki.

01:00:58.680 --> 01:00:59.980
Uh, well...

01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:02.940
It says here, I hate dry rice.

01:01:03.000 --> 01:01:03.220
What?

01:01:03.900 --> 01:01:04.800
I'm not too sure.

01:01:05.980 --> 01:01:08.300
They're laughing at her joke.

01:01:08.600 --> 01:01:10.120
I have to do something.

01:01:10.360 --> 01:01:12.450
That fake mugay is actually...

01:01:33.400 --> 01:01:33.920
What?

01:01:44.690 --> 01:01:46.780
No, you're back! Are you alright?

01:01:47.240 --> 01:01:48.480
I'm so worried.

01:01:48.730 --> 01:01:50.170
Did anyone try to hurt you?

01:01:51.960 --> 01:01:53.000
You're soaked.

01:01:54.980 --> 01:01:56.220
You'll catch a cold.

01:01:57.220 --> 01:01:58.800
Here, I'll fill the bathtub.

01:02:01.340 --> 01:02:02.700
We'll eat once you get out.

01:02:04.600 --> 01:02:06.380
Oh my, I haven't started cooking yet.

01:02:12.260 --> 01:02:13.640
Hey, thank you.

01:02:14.260 --> 01:02:27.800
The feelings of others can be a mystery to us.

01:02:28.140 --> 01:02:29.720
Best we can do is guess.

01:02:30.350 --> 01:02:32.710
You shouldn't assume that you have someone else figured out.

01:02:36.200 --> 01:02:38.180
Okay, see you later.

01:02:39.660 --> 01:02:39.820
What?

01:02:41.060 --> 01:02:42.540
Hey, wait up!

01:02:47.540 --> 01:02:51.940
You know, I had completely forgotten that we had all made plans to walk home together today.

01:02:52.200 --> 01:02:53.440
Are you feeling all right?

01:02:53.910 --> 01:02:55.090
Of course I am!

01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:03.520
Hey, Hinore, thinking I'm going to stay over at your house tonight.

01:03:04.200 --> 01:03:04.540
What?

01:03:04.870 --> 01:03:06.090
What are you talking about?

01:03:06.330 --> 01:03:10.530
I'll go to your house, eat your food, and then we'll sleep together.

01:03:10.810 --> 01:03:11.550
Wait, what?

01:03:12.100 --> 01:03:13.040
Are you nuts?

01:03:13.340 --> 01:03:14.820
Is this some kind of prank?

01:03:15.570 --> 01:03:16.350
You mean I can't?

01:03:16.390 --> 01:03:17.050
Of course not.

01:03:17.390 --> 01:03:18.870
What the heck is wrong with you?

01:03:19.360 --> 01:03:20.900
I can't believe I was worried about you.

01:03:21.270 --> 01:03:22.270
Let's go, Isami.

01:03:23.320 --> 01:03:23.580
Okay.

01:03:24.440 --> 01:03:27.280
Wow, she's gone off the deep end, hasn't she?

01:03:28.330 --> 01:03:29.970
I admire you for being her friend.

